        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To further enhance our understanding and management of risks and opportunities related to sustainability, we are focused on continued progress informed by the core principles of the United Nations Global Compact, CEO Water Mandate, Race to Zero, Women’s Empowerment Principles, and the Human Rights Campaign Foundation’s Global Business Coalition, among others.",
